# Project Memory: PPJ.AI.Hub.v2.1

## One-Line Understanding

Central internal hub for PPJ AI tools, bots, automation apps, and utilities.

## Current Outcome

Provide one place for users to find and open the correct AI/automation tool by department or business need.

## Latest Update Summary

Canonical naming populated from portfolio dictionary.

## What This Project Is

Application hub / tool center / landing page for internal AI and automation tools.

## What This Project Is Not

Not a merged replacement for all project documentation or all project notes.

## Key Users

